OL,3,GNEWSA'Full steam ahead on legacy bill',
OL,4,ANI secretary says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe newly-appointed Secretary of State,
OL,7,FSir Chris Bryant, has insisted it is
OL,8,F"full steam ahead" for his government
OL,9,Fwhen it comes to passing Troubles'
OL,10,Flegacy legislation through Parliament.
OL,12,FHe was speaking as he arrived in the
OL,13,FRepublic of Ireland for the first time
OL,14,Fsince taking on the role earlier in the
OL,15,Fsummer.
OL,17,FSir Chris is in Dublin for a series of
OL,18,Fengagements, meeting government
OL,19,Fministers as well as UK and Irish
OL,20,Fbusiness representatives.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
