OL,3,GNEWSA'Full steam ahead on legacy bill',
OL,4,ANI secretary says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has faced criticism for
OL,7,Fdelays in passing the Troubles legacy
OL,8,Fbill, which was introduced last year,
OL,9,Ffollowing agreement on a joint
OL,10,Fframework with the Irish government.
